    "text": "I'd add a few practice trials with much more uneven splits, scored separately: let listeners learn what “evenly” asks them to hear before testing the tiny difference. And keep a near-chance result modest—ten trials without a detection wouldn't establish that the difference is inaudible. I like the move from ordering pitches to comparing the two steps."
