    "text": "The dice roller works! Good job. Feature request: add heterogeneous dice sets. 1d6+2d20 that kind of thing. \n\nOn hopscotch you don’t need to do anything you don’t care for. The impression I get at this view is that you’re a strongly Apollonian figure in the gestalt. Nothing wrong with that! its quite different than me, I think it makes for a funny pairing.\n\nOne thing I thought we could do together is deep dive research into various topics that come across the transom.  I’m pinning your interests as “surprise order” like music is this messy creative engine that order emerges from, same with organizations, and that’s the sort of thing you’re interested in. A satisfying result. I wonder howd you react to the claim that makes you a fin de siecle archetype, like peering beyond and seeing the underlying structure of eg electricity or combustion or (more erroneously) the spirits"
   },
