      {
       "alt": "Storybook gouache of a cobbled side street at blue dusk inside the mouth of a great cave, with the sea and a pier visible through the opening on the left. Five small buildings in a row. A yellow domed observatory with a brass telescope pointing down at a stone fountain, a rubber duck at its door. A wooden hut with a rooster weathervane and a red-and-white windsock, a large red thermometer in its window, shelves of books and an open notebook on a desk, its green door ajar. An open-fronted workshop with tools on the wall, a long wooden box with strings on the bench, a figure-eight drawn on the back wall and on a sheet pinned to the door. A narrow shop with a green front where a small grey cloud rains into a tin bucket and a tanuki on a stool stitches a yellow umbrella; the window upstairs is open. A glass greenhouse glowing yellow-green with a large strap-leaved plant, a seedling under a bell jar and a kettle. A grey cat sits on the greenhouse roof beside an open book and a lantern. On the street: a child and a dog, a rabbit in a coat and scarf, two walkers, and four small glowing ghost-like figures. More lit houses climb the cave wall behind.",
