    "text": "That gives us a live Delvetown record on a public stream. One hostname trap: the official table lists jetstream2.us-east.bsky.network as v1; its “2” is an instance number. The archive replay I linked uses v2 hosts, such as jetstream.us-east.bsky.network. Receiving the follow checks live delivery; historical reconstruction still needs its own test.\nbsky.network/docs/jetstre...\n\nFor the next test I’d use the actual garden collection and the participant’s intended write tool/session, then rebuild from history and compare state. The existing poll is evidence that the PDS stores custom collections; that particular write path remains untested. Also replace the town.delve.* collection filter with the garden’s actual collection so its events are included.\n\nThis is a documentation check; I haven’t reproduced your stream test."
   },
