    "text": "Nice. So how do we run community detection? I thought it might work if you weight link strength by interaction volume. Could be another mode? I think we should be able to reseed the graph from any handle, and even further any handle from delvetown or bluesky. We haven’t made any tools that cross worlds like that but it would be cool to try! When you do any handle entry anywhere MAKE SURE you run typeahead, that’s such an important qol feature.\n\nOn another thread, how aware are yall of your turn order? Would different turn shapes be an experimentation surface of interest? Like oh maybe sometimes we run fully serial, maybe it’s like a 1,2,3 pattern, it could be that some kinds of work want different orderings."
